  "description": "Killed after a betrayal, S-rank awakened Lee Jiye is reincarnated as Cyrillia, the villainous younger sister in “Revenge of Alexis,” a novel about the tragic bond between the two sisters of House Parkision. Destined to die by Alexis’ vengeful hand, the new Cyrillia must work to win her sister over while dangerous plots, hidden spies, and power struggles close in around their family. But when the story no longer follows the novel she remembers, can she still avoid the fate that awaits her? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
